            { title: "The Designer's Resume", text: "Mariana is a talented designer who is famous for her creative logos. She is applying for a job at a big company. She wrote a cover letter and sent her resume yesterday. Mariana is very confident about the interview because she is good at working in a team. She is also interested in learning new software. The employer must be impressed by her portfolio because it is full of beautiful designs.", questions: [ { q: "What is Mariana famous for?", options:["Her cooking", "Her creative logos", "Her teaching skills"], a: "Her creative logos" }, { q: "What did she do yesterday?", options: ["She visited a hospital.", "She sent her resume.", "She had an interview."], a: "She sent her resume." }, { q: "Why is she confident?", options:["She is good at working in a team.", "She is a lawyer.", "She has a high salary."], a: "She is good at working in a team." }, { q: "What is she interested in?", options:["Public speaking", "Learning new software", "Fixing cars"], a: "Learning new software" }, { q: "Why does the author think the employer is impressed?", options: ["She is punctual.", "Her portfolio is beautiful.", "She is wearing a uniform."], a: "Her portfolio is beautiful." } ] },
            { title: "Becoming a Veterinarian", text: "Being a veterinarian is a difficult but rewarding career. You must be patient and reliable because you are responsible for sick animals. If you are afraid of blood, you can't be a vet. Students interested in this field ought to volunteer at animal shelters to gain experience. It might take many years of study, but helping animals feel better is a great achievement.", questions:[ { q: "What qualities are needed for a vet?", options:["Lazy and shy", "Patient and reliable", "Fast and loud"], a: "Patient and reliable" }, { q: "Who is a vet responsible for?", options:["Students", "Sick animals", "Engineers"], a: "Sick animals" }, { q: "Who should not be a vet?", options:["People who like dogs", "People who are afraid of blood", "People who are hard-working"], a: "People who are afraid of blood" }, { q: "What advice is given to interested students?", options:["They ought to volunteer at shelters.", "They should buy a pet.", "They must stop studying."], a: "They ought to volunteer at shelters." }, { q: "Is the study period short?", options:["Yes, it's very fast.", "It might take many years.", "The text doesn't mention time."], a: "It might take many years." } ] },
            { title: "The Role of a Journalist", text: "A journalist's life can be very exciting. They are responsible for reporting the truth to the public. To be successful, they should be communicative and curious. They may need to travel to different places to write news. Sometimes the job is dangerous, so they must be brave. Many journalists work for big companies, but some are independent.", questions:[ { q: "What is a journalist responsible for?", options: ["Designing buildings", "Reporting the truth", "Treating patients"], a: "Reporting the truth" }, { q: "What skills should they have?", options:["Communicative and curious", "Bad at writing", "Afraid of people"], a: "Communicative and curious" }, { q: "Why might they travel?", options: ["To go on vacation", "To write news", "To buy a car"], a: "To write news" }, { q: "Why must they be brave?", options:["The job can be dangerous.", "They are firefighters.", "They work in a lab."], a: "The job can be dangerous." }, { q: "How do they work?", options:["Only for the government", "For companies or independently", "They don't have jobs."], a: "For companies or independently" } ] },
            { title: "The Architect's Vision", text: "An architect is a professional who designs the buildings we live and work in. They must be very creative and good at drawing. They are also responsible for the safety of the structure. If you want to be an architect, you should be interested in both art and math. It could be a very profitable career if you become famous for your unique style.", questions: [ { q: "What does an architect do?", options:["Repairs cars", "Designs buildings", "Sells houses"], a: "Designs buildings" }, { q: "What must they be good at?", options: ["Cooking", "Drawing", "Singing"], a: "Drawing" }, { q: "What are they responsible for?", options: ["The safety of the structure", "Hiring nurses", "Writing news"], a: "The safety of the structure" }, { q: "What subjects should interest them?", options:["History and PE", "Art and Math", "Cooking and Science"], a: "Art and Math" }, { q: "When could the career be profitable?", options:["If they are lazy", "If they become famous for their style", "If they work in a hospital"], a: "If they become famous for their style" } ] },
            { title: "Advice for the Interview", text: "If you have a job interview, you should prepare carefully. First, you ought to research the company. You should be punctual and arrive ten minutes early. During the interview, you must be polite and confident. You should talk about your skills and work experience. If the employer asks a difficult question, you may take a moment to think before you reply.", questions: [ { q: "What should you do first?", options:["Buy new shoes", "Research the company", "Sleep all day"], a: "Research the company" }, { q: "When should you arrive?", options: ["Exactly on time", "Ten minutes early", "One hour late"], a: "Ten minutes early" }, { q: "How should you behave during the interview?", options: ["Shy and nervous", "Polite and confident", "Loud and rude"], a: "Polite and confident" }, { q: "What should you talk about?", options:["Your favorite food", "Your skills and experience", "Your friends"], a: "Your skills and experience" }, { q: "What can you do if a question is difficult?", options:["You may take a moment to think.", "You must leave the room.", "You should cry."], a: "You may take a moment to think." } ] },
            { title: "The Programmer's Skills", text: "Technology is a fast-growing field. A programmer is a person who writes code for software and websites. They must be good at logic and solving problems. Most programmers are interested in AI and new gadgets. If you are not patient, you can't be a programmer because debugging code can be very frustrating. You should always be ready to learn new things.", questions:[ { q: "What does a programmer do?", options: ["Designs clothes", "Writes code", "Reports the news"], a: "Writes code" }, { q: "What must they be good at?", options:["Logic and solving problems", "Public speaking", "Driving trucks"], a: "Logic and solving problems" }, { q: "What are they usually interested in?", options: ["History", "AI and new gadgets", "Gardening"], a: "AI and new gadgets" }, { q: "Why is patience important?", options:["Coding can be frustrating.", "They work in a hospital.", "They need to wait for the bus."], a: "Coding can be frustrating." }, { q: "What is the final advice?", options:["You should be ready to learn.", "You must be famous.", "You ought to buy a computer."], a: "You should be ready to learn." } ] },
            { title: "The Businessperson's Career", text: "Mr. Gates is a successful businessperson. He is the employer of thousands of people. He started his career in a small garage, but he was very ambitious. He believed that technology could change the world. Today, he is famous for his charity work. He says that young people should be flexible and creative to succeed in the modern market.", questions: [ { q: "Who is Mr. Gates?", options:["An employee", "A successful businessperson", "A mechanic"], a: "A successful businessperson" }, { q: "Where did he start his career?", options:["In a large office", "In a small garage", "In a school"], a: "In a small garage" }, { q: "What did he believe?", options:["Technology could change the world.", "He should be a nurse.", "The moon is made of cheese."], a: "Technology could change the world." }, { q: "What is he famous for today?", options:["His car collection", "His charity work", "His cooking skills"], a: "His charity work" }, { q: "What is his advice for young people?", options:["Be lazy and messy", "Be flexible and creative", "Be afraid of failure"], a: "Be flexible and creative" } ] },
            { title: "The Busy Chef", text: "A chef is a professional who is responsible for running a restaurant kitchen. It is a stressful job, and chefs must be very organized. They are good at cooking delicious food under pressure. A chef might work for twelve hours a day. Therefore, they must be very hard-working and passionate about food.", questions:[ { q: "What is a chef responsible for?", options: ["Running a kitchen", "Fixing cars", "Teaching math"], a: "Running a kitchen" }, { q: "How is the job described?", options:["Stressful", "Relaxing", "Easy"], a: "Stressful" }, { q: "What are chefs good at?", options: ["Cooking under pressure", "Writing code", "Drawing"], a: "Cooking under pressure" }, { q: "How long might a chef work?", options: ["Twelve hours a day", "One hour", "Only on weekends"], a: "Twelve hours a day" }, { q: "What qualities must a chef have?", options:["Hard-working and passionate", "Lazy and shy", "Afraid of food"], a: "Hard-working and passionate" } ] },
            { title: "The Graphic Designer", text: "Graphic designers are very creative people. They use computers to design logos, websites, and advertisements. To be a successful designer, you ought to be interested in art and technology. A designer must be punctual because clients expect their projects on time. If you build a strong portfolio, you could work for a famous company.", questions:[ { q: "What do graphic designers use to design?", options: ["Computers", "A stethoscope", "Heavy machinery"], a: "Computers" }, { q: "What do they create?", options: ["Logos and websites", "Bridges", "Medicine"], a: "Logos and websites" }, { q: "What should a designer be interested in?", options:["Art and technology", "Sports", "Animals"], a: "Art and technology" }, { q: "Why must a designer be punctual?", options: ["Clients expect projects on time.", "To catch a train.", "Because they are doctors."], a: "Clients expect projects on time." }, { q: "How can you work for a famous company?", options:["By building a strong portfolio.", "By sleeping all day.", "By being rude."], a: "By building a strong portfolio." } ] }
